                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I want to give this game a thumbs up just because of the idea its based on but i can't yet.\nGoing into the game you cant rebind any of your keys. When you go to choose your server If your american you get 2 servers to choose from la or la =(.  Then when you start just like a lot of survival games you wont know wtf is going on.  But the real kicker is you dont know what your harvesting or how much of it your harvesting.  And when you have it harvested theres no clear idea how to build outside of some weapons and tools.  Base building and pvp are the 2 reasons i play survival games. So when you cant figure out how to build something ie: A foundation. It can be a tad bit frustrating. while trying to build the tool tips bug some stuff is in both english and chinese.  Surviving seems meaningless since when you die of starvation or dehydration you just respawn with all of your stuff no concequence what so ever so dont bother farming up materials to stay alive also just log out with your stuff on you since your body dissapears from the game. From the pvp side of it a friend and i spent 30 minutes camping a poor soul bc theres only 1 respawn point on the map so he kept spawning infront of us and we kept killing him...lol right? probably not for him or the other people we did it to.  The pvp wasnt rewarding tho because you cant loot the player! Also sometimes the player could just slowly back step away from you and it would make it impossible to hit him.\n\nThe one thing thats super nice is at lvl 6 you can get a mount/bike and it makes getting around amazing just with the keys werent n to summon and h to get on.\n\nOther things that we expect from a ea game: Random dc. Random sticking and having to reconnect. Random lag while driving (that weird rubberbanding lag back and forth).\n\nI really cant wait to see if they make this game into something awesome tho I find it odd theres only like 7 people playing on release. out of 4 servers 2na and 2eu",
